    "updated_at": "2016-10-11T16:18:00Z",
    "body": "I agree with @jakearchibald that Edge's behavior is probably the more desirable one for web devs.  The \"bizarro-pants\" behavior in Chrome is based on a (possibly incorrect) literal interpretation of the spec, which I agree is not that useful.\n",
